			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Retrieval-augmented chat with Databricks\nThe **Databricks Vector Store** (retrieve-as-tool) gives the AI Agent a knowledge-base search tool backed by a Databricks Vector Search index.\n\n- **Embeddings Databricks** embeds the agent's query the same way the index was built.\n- **Databricks Chat Model** generates the answer using the retrieved context.\n\nCreate and sync the index in Databricks first, then set its three-level name (`catalog.schema.index`).",
